NEURAL file[.NN]
  A small neural net (jNeuralNetwork's way), served on a port named
  after its training file: RUN 2 NEURAL DUNGEON. It learns records -
  prop=value words, a line each (*n: seen n times) - and, asked with
  some props, gives back the record that matches best.
  Messages (ASK DUNGEON ...):
    Q prop=value ... [prop?]  the best record: "score prop=value ..."
                   (0-100; prop?: that prop only); numbers match by
                   how near they are, val* by its start; "?" none
    T prop=value ...  learn a record (again: its weights grow)
    S  save;  E  save and end (Q at its keyboard)
  Up to 200 records, 8 props each. RATMODEL.TXT, section 8.
